            <ArticleTitle>School clinics for adolescents with asthma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1281-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Adolescents with asthma often have a poor attendance record at primary care review clinics. A school-based asthma clinic project was set up to see whether this service could improve adherence with treatment and clinic attendance.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
